      "html": "<div style='display:grid'><div class='speech-bubble prosecution-left'><div class='prosecution-image-left'><\/div><div class='right-text'> Conditions can control what text is displayed. Questions can also depend on conditions, but must be specified in the app.R document. <\/div><\/div>  <div class='speech-bubble firearms-right'><div class='left-text'> This speaker is labelled as firearms. In this template, there are three conditions listed. If the condition is listed as All, the text will be present for all conditions. <\/div><div class='firearms-image-right'><\/div><\/div><br/> <div class='speech-bubble prosecution-left'><div class='prosecution-image-left'><\/div><div class='right-text'> If a condition is specified, then the text will only appear in the specified condition. <\/div><\/div>  <div class='speech-bubble firearms-right'><div class='left-text'> For example, this text only appears when Condition_1 is set as A. <\/div><div class='firearms-image-right'><\/div><\/div><br/> <div class='speech-bubble prosecution-left'><div class='prosecution-image-left'><\/div><div class='right-text'> If Conditions are re-labelled in this testimony document to match your experiment, they must also be relabelled in the app.R document. <\/div><\/div>  <div class='speech-bubble firearms-right'><div class='left-text'> The app.R document allows users to specify how often the condition appears. <\/div><div class='firearms-image-right'><\/div><\/div><br/> <div class='speech-bubble prosecution-left'><div class='prosecution-image-left'><\/div><div class='right-text'> Images can also be added to the testimony. The narrator Speaker is used to define the Exhibit number, without a speech bubble. The image Speaker is used for the image itself, specified using HTML format. The image is located in the www file. <\/div><\/div>   <center>---Exhibit A---<\/center><br/>   <img src='security.jpg' alt='security' style='width: 50%' height='' class='center'><br/><center><font size='-3'>image credit, if necessary<\/font><\/center>  <div class='speech-bubble firearms-right'><div class='left-text'> The above image clearly depicts the defendant not keeping off the grass. <\/div><div class='firearms-image-right'><\/div><\/div><br/> <div class='speech-bubble defense-left'><div class='defense-image-left'><\/div><div class='right-text'> Conditions can also change the number of pages in the testimony <\/div><\/div> <\/div>",
